      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>The error is caused by the app providing the function.</para>
          <para>For example, the app crashed when the system is executing the request.</para>
          <para>Errors in the category fall in the range 3000-3999 inclusive.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/appfunctions/AppFunctionException#ERROR_CATEGORY_APP" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.appfunctions.AppFunctionException.ERROR_CATEGORY_APP</code>.</a></format></para>
