      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>The error is caused by the app requesting a function execution.</para>
          <para>For example, the caller provided invalid parameters in the execution request e.g. an invalid function ID.</para>
          <para>Errors in the category fall in the range 1000-1999 inclusive.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/appfunctions/AppFunctionException#ERROR_CATEGORY_REQUEST_ERROR" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.appfunctions.AppFunctionException.ERROR_CATEGORY_REQUEST_ERROR</code>.</a></format></para>
